'''Manager Cat & Clerk Cat''' are a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained for free after registering yourself in the [https://www.nyanko-daishoten.jp/ Nyanko Daishoten Online] website, then clicking on the designated button or banner on the site to receive them in-game. They were added in [[Version 14.7 Update|Version 14.7]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 823
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Manager Cat & Clerk Cat
|name2 = Manager Cat & Clerk Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Manager Cat & Clerk Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Manager Cat & Clerk Cat CC is an anti-Metal tanker, similar to the likes of [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] and [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]]. However, they have a 100% chance to [[Freeze]] all Metals within their range for 1 second (27% uptime), and come with Area Attack to boot!

At Lv.50, they have ''472,000 effective HP'' against Metals, giving them almost 4x the bulk of a Lv.50 [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Future Cat]] (122,800). They also have [[Immune to Knockback|Knockback Immunity]], which gives them a reliable matchup against [[Super Metal Hippoe]], something that most meatshields and tanks fail to achieve.

